// What a module's default fold refuses once names are bound, and what it does
// not put in reach.
//
// Name-resolution stage. Whether each name on a 'mod' line's 'use' is a public
// name of the module is known only once the module's own names and folds are,
// so it is judged in the fold pass that reports, at the 'mod' line, once --
// never again at an import that takes the default.
//
// The folder holds:
//   lib/lib.cone         a default naming what is missing and what is private
//   stars/stars.cone     a '* but' default leaving out a name it has not got
//   clash/clash.cone     a bare import of lib whose default meets a declaration
//   picky/picky.cone     an import of lib with a clause of its own, and a bare
//                        import of stars

mod module_mod_default_nameres;
